There are a few things that could be done to make Stormbringer a little
more unique/powerful, seeing as lots of people complain that Chaotics
get the worst artifacts of the bunch.

Stormbringer is basically the quintessential cursed sword of legend.  I
think that Stormbringer should be generated cursed, and incapable of
becoming blessed.  When cursed, the weapon should be the most effective
- perhaps the damage is increased or it drains more life.

In addition, #dipping a cursed Stormy into holy water should create
uncursed water, and #dipping into water should create holy water.  The
only way to uncurse the blade would be divine intervention.



